       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EL-MULTI-TABLA-DIABOLICO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-CONTROL.
       05 WS-COUNT PIC 9(2) VALUE 5.
       05 WS-SEARCH-KEY PIC X(5) VALUE "EAGLE".
       05 WS-FOUND-IDX PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
       05 WS-RESULT-NUM PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
       05 WS-RESULT-OUT PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-DYNAMIC-TABLE.
       05 WS-TABLE-SIZE PIC 9(2) VALUE 5.
       05 WS-ITEM OCCURS 1 TO 10 TIMES DEPENDING ON WS-TABLE-SIZE
          ASCENDING KEY IS WS-ITEM-ID INDEXED BY WS-IDX.
       10 WS-ITEM-ID PIC X(5).
       10 WS-ITEM-VAL PIC S9(5) COMP.
       01 WS-RAW-SOURCE.
       05 FILLER PIC X(10) VALUE "ALPHA00100".
       05 FILLER PIC X(10) VALUE "BETA 00200".
       05 FILLER PIC X(10) VALUE "DELTA00400".
       05 FILLER PIC X(10) VALUE "EAGLE00500".
       05 FILLER PIC X(10) VALUE "GAMMA00300".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
       DISPLAY "INICIO DE DIABLURA NUMERO 2".
       PERFORM CARGAR-DATOS.
       SEARCH ALL WS-ITEM
       AT END
       MOVE -1 TO WS-FOUND-IDX
       WHEN WS-ITEM-ID (WS-IDX) = WS-SEARCH-KEY
       SET WS-FOUND-IDX TO WS-IDX
       MOVE WS-ITEM-VAL (WS-IDX) TO WS-RESULT-NUM
       END-SEARCH.
       EVALUATE TRUE
       WHEN WS-FOUND-IDX = -1
       DISPLAY "ELEMENTO NO ENCONTRADO"
       WHEN WS-RESULT-NUM > 300
       PERFORM CALCULO-RECURSIVO-IMPLICITO
       WHEN OTHER
       DISPLAY "VALOR BAJO DETECTADO"
       END-EVALUATE.
       STOP RUN.
       CARGAR-DATOS.
       MOVE 5 TO WS-TABLE-SIZE.
       SET WS-IDX TO 1.
       MOVE "ALPHA" TO WS-ITEM-ID (1).
       MOVE 100 TO WS-ITEM-VAL (1).
       MOVE "BETA " TO WS-ITEM-ID (2).
       MOVE 200 TO WS-ITEM-VAL (2).
       MOVE "DELTA" TO WS-ITEM-ID (3).
       MOVE 400 TO WS-ITEM-VAL (3).
       MOVE "EAGLE" TO WS-ITEM-ID (4).
       MOVE 500 TO WS-ITEM-VAL (4).
       MOVE "GAMMA" TO WS-ITEM-ID (5).
       MOVE 300 TO WS-ITEM-VAL (5).
       EXIT.
       CALCULO-RECURSIVO-IMPLICITO.
       ADD 50 TO WS-RESULT-NUM.
       IF WS-RESULT-NUM < 700
       PERFORM CALCULO-RECURSIVO-IMPLICITO
       ELSE
       MOVE WS-RESULT-NUM TO WS-RESULT-OUT
       DISPLAY "VALOR RECURSIVO FINAL: " WS-RESULT-OUT
       END-IF.
       EXIT.
       